![Foto de Saman Taheri no Unsplash](cover.jpg)

_Liquor Tags_. Inspirado nos embed tags do dev.to (liquid tags),
obtém dados Open Graph de URLs e gera o resultado usando templates
EEx pseudo. Útil para criar pré-visualizações de sites usando dados
do Open Graph.

## Instalação

```elixir
Mix.install([
  {:liquor, "~> 1.0.1"},
  {:req, "~> 0.4.14"}, # Just for demostration
  {:kino, "~> 0.12.3"} # Just for demostration
])
```

```elixir
alias Liquor.Tags.Tag

content = """
{% github ElixirCL % }
{% embed https://ninjas.cl % }
"""

tags = [
  Tag.new("github", "Github: < %= og.url %>", "https://github.com"),
  Tag.new("embed", "Website: < %= og.title %>")
]

# Fetch only needs to return the HTML string
fetch = fn url -> Req.get!(url) |> then(& &1.body) end

Liquor.render(content, tags, fetch)
|> Kino.Text.new()
```

### Renderiza

```text
Github: https://github.com/ElixirCL
Website: Ninja Software Chile (Ninjas.cl)
```

```github
elixircl/liquor | Etiquetas Liquid que obtienen datos OpenGraph y los renderizan
```
